# Context root for infra/pos-api/Dockerfile, the one build in this repo whose
# image needs a sibling directory (infra/shared) — see that Dockerfile's own
# comment for why. Every other infra/* service still builds from its own
# subdirectory as context and never reads this file.
node_modules/
dist/
.env
.env.example
*.log

# Only pos-api/ and shared/ are ever COPYed from this context. Excluding the
# sibling services keeps what gets sent to the Docker daemon to what's actually
# used — none of it ends up in the image either way, since nothing here COPYs it.
vision-proxy/
clerk-agent-relay/
appid-token-relay/

pos-api/src/**/*.test.mjs
pos-api/smoke.mjs
pos-api/README.md
shared/src/**/*.test.mjs
